    <briefdescription>
<para>Wave D — Sharding High-Cardinality Stress Tests. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Three stress cases exercising the sharding subsystem under high-cardinality and concurrency conditions using in-process stubs and seed-42 determinism.</para>
<sect1 id="test__sharding__highcardinality__stress_8cpp_1autotoc_md1_1s1"><sect2 id="test__sharding__highcardinality__stress_8cpp_1autotoc_md1">
<title>Cases</title><para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>HighCardinalityCrossShardRoute : 50 000 keys, 8-thread concurrent routing</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>ConcurrentMigrationStress : concurrent migrations across all shards</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>SkewedLoadAntiEntropyStress : anti-entropy under skewed write load</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
</sect2></sect1>
